{"game": "arma-3", "language": "english", "appid": 107410, "month": "2014-07", "window": 4, "start_date": 1406160000, "end_date": 1406851199, "month_true_total": 757, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 11:02:28 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "11498407", "author": {"steamid": "76561198018680946", "personaname": "Dacharlie Kirkland", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/shekelgod01/", "num_games_owned": 218, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 41315, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 23023, "last_played": 1763763252, "avatar": "bb2badf1a0adead845f4947535b2797745b22a52"}, "language": "english", "review": "Another amazing game from BI, ARMA 3 is great when playing with friends and even people you might not even know, some missions require teamwork or you will probably fail. Although it has its pros and cons :\n\nPros:\nAmazing engine\nNicely detailed gear and vehicles etc (not really an eye sore)\nSomewhat good community\nA different campaign which talks about a island that is in the state of war.\nSteam Workshop\n\nCons:\nThere are not a ton of vehicles and weapons, most of them are just the same.\nMore clothing then actual things like vehicles.\nETC\n\n9/10 Awesome game but really needs more content in the original game.", "timestamp_created": 1406848531, "timestamp_updated": 1406848531, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "11498212", "author": {"steamid": "76561198011028663", "personaname": "Cuzant", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198011028663/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 204512, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_revi