fficult.  But if you have a group of friends to help you take on some of the missions, you will enjoy this game.  The multiplayer is awesome.  Before I found this game, I had always been searching for a game with a gamemode that has teams with about 65 players or so each all fighting over one point.  The workshop feature makes the game even better, being able to download new missions whenever you finish the ones you already have.  This is overall a pretty cool game.", "timestamp_created": 1406842579, "timestamp_updated": 1406842579, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.502525031566619873", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "11497098", "author": {"steamid": "76561198118683120", "personaname": "Navigator", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198118683120/", "num_games_owned": 244, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 133407, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 33934, "last_played": 1787799292, "avatar": "e4c5e2ab869df41657cb2108f0d01723d0ba7ba7"}, "language": "english", "review": "Its so great.", "timestamp_created": 1406841384, "timestamp_updated": 1440209897, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}]}